ssage in the queue and walks away; B picks it up when it's ready. The queue absorbs spikes, survives outages, and lets each side scale independently. Email notifications, order processing, image resizing, fraud checks — the unglamorous plumbing of the internet runs on queues.", "start": 12.575, "end": 44.65, "words": [{"text": "Sooner", "start": 12.875, "end": 13.175}, {"text": "or", "start": 13.175, "end": 13.3}, {"text": "later", "start": 13.3, "end": 13.65}, {"text": "every", "start": 13.65, "end": 14.0}, {"text": "growing", "start": 14.0, "end": 14.375}, {"text": "system", "start": 14.375, "end": 14.7}, {"text": "hits", "start": 14.7, "end": 14.938}, {"text": "the", "start": 14.938, "end": 15.025}, {"text": "same", "start": 15.025, "end": 15.3}, {"text": "wall", "start": 15.3, "end": 15.95}, {"text": "Service", "start": 15.95, "end": 16.45}, {"text": "A", "start": 16.45, "end": 16.625}, {"text": "needs", "start": 16.625, "end": 16.875}, {"text": "Service", "start": 16.875, "end": 17.25}, {"text": "B", "start": 17.25, "end": 17.425}, {"text": "to", "start": 17.425, "end": 17.525}, {"text": "do", "start": 17.525, "end": 17.675}, {"text": "something", "start": 17.675, "end": 18.05}, {"text": "but", "start": 18.05, "end": 18.225}, {"text": "Service", "start": 18.225, "end": 18.625}, {"text": "B", "start": 18.625, "end": 18.85}, {"text": "is", "start": 18.85, "end": 18.987}, {"text": "slow", "start": 18.987, "end": 19.375}, {"text": "or", "start": 19.375, "end": 19.575}, {"text": "down", "start": 19.575, "end": 19.825}, {"text": "or", "start": 19.825, "end": 19.95}, {"text": "drowning", "start": 19.95, "end": 20.95}, {"text": "If", "start": 20.95, "end": 21.188}, {"text": "A", "start": 21.188, "end": 21.25}, {"text": "calls", "start": 21.25, "end": 21.575}, {"text": "B", "start": 21.575, "end": 21.725}, {"text": "directly", "start": 21.725, "end": 22.188}, {"text": "and", "start": 22.188, "end": 22.3}, {"text": "waits", "start": 22.3, "end": 22.65}, {"text": "A's", "