1.275}, {"text": "dining", "start": 61.275, "end": 61.275}, {"text": "room", "start": 61.275, "end": 61.275}, {"text": "The", "start": 61.275, "end": 61.375}, {"text": "rail", "start": 61.375, "end": 61.675}, {"text": "is", "start": 61.675, "end": 61.825}, {"text": "the", "start": 61.825, "end": 61.938}, {"text": "queue", "start": 61.938, "end": 62.35}, {"text": "and", "start": 62.35, "end": 62.537}, {"text": "the", "start": 62.537, "end": 62.625}, {"text": "whole", "start": 62.625, "end": 62.875}, {"text": "restaurant", "start": 62.875, "end": 63.388}, {"text": "would", "start": 63.388, "end": 63.525}, {"text": "collapse", "start": 63.525, "end": 63.938}, {"text": "without", "start": 63.938, "end": 64.312}, {"text": "it", "start": 64.312, "end": 64.975}]}, {"index": 5, "kind": "prose", "text": "The basic shape", "start": 65.275, "end": 66.925, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 65.5, "end": 65.6}, {"text": "basic", "start": 65.6, "end": 66.038}, {"text": "shape", "start": 66.038, "end": 66.6}]}, {"index": 6, "kind": "prose", "text": "Producers and consumers never talk to each other directly — they only know the queue. That decoupling buys you three things: temporal decoupling (B can be down when A sends), load leveling (spikes become a backlog, not an outage), and independent scaling (add consumers without touching producers).", "start": 66.925, "end": 84.375, "words": [{"text": "Producers", "start": 67.175, "end": 67.75}, {"text": "and", "start": 67.75, "end": 67.875}, {"text": "consumers", "start": 67.875, "end": 68.4}, {"text": "never", "start": 68.4, "end": 68.65}, {"text": "talk", "start": 68.65, "end": 68.875}, {"text": "to", "start": 68.875, "end": 68.962}, {"text": "each", "start": 68.962, "end": 69.138}, {"text": "other", "start": 69.138, "end": 69.35}, {"text": "directly", "start": 69.35, "end": 69.9}, {"text": "they", "start": 69.9, "end": 70.1}, {"text": "only", "start": 70.1, "end": 70.4}, {"text": "know", "start": 70.4, "end": 70.587}, {"text": "the",