, "end": 86.175}, {"text": "poison", "start": 86.175, "end": 87.15}]}, {"index": 8, "kind": "prose", "text": "This is the section that separates \"we use a queue\" from \"we understand our queue\":", "start": 87.425, "end": 92.25, "words": [{"text": "This", "start": 87.675, "end": 87.875}, {"text": "is", "start": 87.875, "end": 88.013}, {"text": "the", "start": 88.013, "end": 88.1}, {"text": "section", "start": 88.1, "end": 88.5}, {"text": "that", "start": 88.5, "end": 88.625}, {"text": "separates", "start": 88.625, "end": 89.4}, {"text": "we", "start": 89.4, "end": 89.55}, {"text": "use", "start": 89.55, "end": 89.737}, {"text": "a", "start": 89.737, "end": 89.812}, {"text": "queue", "start": 89.812, "end": 90.125}, {"text": "from", "start": 90.125, "end": 90.362}, {"text": "we", "start": 90.362, "end": 90.487}, {"text": "understand", "start": 90.487, "end": 91.013}, {"text": "our", "start": 91.013, "end": 91.175}, {"text": "queue", "start": 91.175, "end": 91.95}]}, {"index": 9, "kind": "prose", "text": "At-most-once — the message may be lost, but never duplicated. Fast, and fine for metrics or heartbeats where a dropped sample is harmless.", "start": 92.25, "end": 100.9, "words": [{"text": "At", "start": 92.5, "end": 93.388}, {"text": "most", "start": 93.388, "end": 93.388}, {"text": "once", "start": 93.388, "end": 93.388}, {"text": "the", "start": 93.388, "end": 93.475}, {"text": "message", "start": 93.475, "end": 93.85}, {"text": "may", "start": 93.85, "end": 93.987}, {"text": "be", "start": 93.987, "end": 94.1}, {"text": "lost", "start": 94.1, "end": 94.525}, {"text": "but", "start": 94.525, "end": 94.725}, {"text": "never", "start": 94.725, "end": 95.0}, {"text": "duplicated", "start": 95.0, "end": 96.225}, {"text": "Fast", "start": 96.225, "end": 96.875}, {"text": "and", "start": 96.875, "end": 97.075}, {"text": "fine", "start": 97.075, "end": 97.35}, {"text": "for", "start": 97.35, "end": 97.475}, {"text": "metrics", "start": 97.475, "end": 97.95}, {"text": "or", "start": 97.95, "end": 98.075}, {"text": "heartbeats", "start": 98.075, "end": 98.612}, {"text": "where", "start": 98.612, "end": 98.737}, {"text": "a", "start": 98.737, "end": 98.8}, {"text": "dropped", "start": 98.8, "end": 99.1}, {"text": "sample", "start": 99.1, "end": 99.463}, {"text": "is", "start": 99.463, "end": 99.575}, {"text": "harmless", "start": 99.575, "end": 100.6}]}, {"index": 10, "kind": "prose", "text": "At-least-once — the message will arrive, possibly more than once. The workhorse default (SQS standard queues, RabbitMQ with acknowledgments). Your consumers must be idempotent — processing the same message twice must be safe.", "start": 100.9, "end": 114.55, "words": [{"text": "At", "start": 101.15, "end": 101.938}, {"text": "least", "start": 101.938, "end": 101.938}, {"text": "once", "start": 101.938, "end": 101.938}, {"text": "the", "start": 101.938, "end": 102.025}, {"text": "message", "start": 102.025, "end": 102.413}, {"text": "will", "start": 102.413, "end": 102.55}, {"text": "arrive", "start": 102.55, "end": 103.0}, {"text": "possibly", "start": 103.0, "end": 103.525}, {"text": "more", "start": 103.525, "end": 103.688}, {"text": "than", "start": 103.688, "end": 103.825}, {"text": "once", "start": 103.825, "end": 104.725}, {"text": "The", "start": 104.725, "end": 104.925}, {"text": "workhorse", "start": 104.925, "end": 105.4}, {"text": "default", "start": 105.4, "end": 105.85}, {"text": "SQS", "start": 105.85, "end": 106.375}, {"text": "standard", "start": 106.375, "end": 106.775}, {"text": "queues", "start": 106.775, "end": 107.35}, {"text": "RabbitMQ", "start": 107.35, "end": 108.113}, {"text": "with", "start": 108.113, "end": 108.238}, {"text": "acknowledgments", "start": 108.238, "end": 109.325}, {"text": "Your", "start": 109.325, "end": 109.65}, {"text": "consumers", "start": 109.65, "end": 110.225}, {"text": "must", "start": 110.225, "end": 110.438}, {"text": "be", "start": 110.438, "end": 110.538}, {"text": "idempotent", "start": 110.538, "end": 111.425}, {"text": "processing", "start": 111.425, "end": 112.038}, {"text": "the", "start": 112.038, "end": 112.138}, {"text": "same", "start": 112.138, "end": 112.4}, {"text": "message", "start": 112.4, "end": 112.775}, {"text": "twice", "start": 112.775, "end": 113.125}, {"text": "must", "start": 113.125, "end": 113.312}, {"text": "be", "start": 113.312, "end": 113.438}, {"text": "safe", "start": 113.438, "end": 114.275}]}, {"index": 11, "kind": "prose", "text": "Exactly-once — arrives once and only once. Sounds ideal, sounds expensive, and — here's the industry's open secret — is usually at-least-once plus idempotency wearing a trench coat. Kafka offers exactly-once semantics via transactions, but only within Kafka-to-Kafka flows; the moment your consumer calls an external API, you're back to designing for duplicates.", "start": 114.55, "end": 137.025, "words": [{"text": "Exactly", "start": 114.8, "end": 115.275}, {"text": "once", "start": 115.275, "end": 115.638}, {"text": "arrives", "start": 115.638, "end": 116.125}, {"text": "once", "start": 116.125, "end": 116.412}, {"text": "and", "start": 116.412, "end": 116.513}, {"text": "only", "start": 116.513, "end": 116.775}, {"text": "once", "start": 116.775, "end": 117.525}, {"text": "Sounds", "start": 117.525, "end": 117.962}, {"text": "ideal", "start": 117.962, "end": 118.4}, {"text": "sounds", "start": 118.4, "end": 118.737}, {"text": "expensive", "start": 118.737, "end": 119.55}, {"text": "and", "start": 119.55, "end": 119.737}, {"text": "here's", "start": 119.737, "end": 120.062}, {"text": "the", "start": 120.062, "end": 120.15}, {"text": "industry's", "start": 120.15, "end": 120.65}, {"text": "open", "start": 120.65, "end": 120.987}, {"text": "secret", "start": 120.987, "end": 121.575}, {"text": "is", "start": 121.575, "end": 121.775}, {"text": "usually", "start": 121.775, "end": 122.125}, {"text": "at", "start": 122.125, "end": 122.8}, {"text": "least", "start": 122.8, "end": 122.8}, {"text"