", "start": 186.575, "end": 186.875}, {"text": "overflows", "start": 186.875, "end": 188.025}]}, {"index": 17, "kind": "prose", "text": "Queues absorb spikes — until they can't. Every queue is finite, and \"what happens when it's full\" is a design decision, not an accident:", "start": 188.3, "end": 196.675, "words": [{"text": "Queues", "start": 188.55, "end": 188.85}, {"text": "absorb", "start": 188.85, "end": 189.275}, {"text": "spikes", "start": 189.275, "end": 189.738}, {"text": "until", "start": 189.738, "end": 190.038}, {"text": "they", "start": 190.038, "end": 190.175}, {"text": "can't", "start": 190.175, "end": 190.975}, {"text": "Every", "start": 190.975, "end": 191.4}, {"text": "queue", "start": 191.4, "end": 191.613}, {"text": "is", "start": 191.613, "end": 191.75}, {"text": "finite", "start": 191.75, "end": 192.475}, {"text": "and", "start": 192.475, "end": 192.713}, {"text": "what", "start": 192.713, "end": 192.9}, {"text": "happens", "start": 192.9, "end": 193.263}, {"text": "when", "start": 193.263, "end": 193.388}, {"text": "it's", "start": 193.388, "end": 193.575}, {"text": "full", "start": 193.575, "end": 193.9}, {"text": "is", "start": 193.9, "end": 194.062}, {"text": "a", "start": 194.062, "end": 194.125}, {"text": "design", "start": 194.125, "end": 194.5}, {"text": "decision", "start": 194.5, "end": 195.0}, {"text": "not", "start": 195.0, "end": 195.238}, {"text": "an", "start": 195.238, "end": 195.325}, {"text": "accident", "start": 195.325, "end": 196.375}]}, {"index": 18, "kind": "prose", "text": "Block the producer — simple, but now the producer feels the pain (RabbitMQ does this with publisher confirms and flow control).", "start": 196.675, "end": 204.625, "words": [{"text": "Block", "start": 196.925, "end": 197.163}, {"text": "the", "start": 197.163, "end": 197.25}, {"text": "producer", "start": 197.25, "end": 197.775}, {"text": "simple", "start": 197.775, "end": 198.575}, {"text": "but", "start": 198.575, "end": 198.825}, {"text": "now", 